  "notes": "SENSE 1 - CONJUNCTION:\n- Used at sentence start to give a reason or excuse\n- Has a casual, sometimes childish or defensive tone\n- Often paired with 〜んだもん, 〜んだから\n\nSENSE 2 - PARTICLE:\n- Noun + だって: Even (noun), (noun) also\n- Similar to でも but more casual/emphatic\n- {誰|だれ}だって (anyone), {何|なに}だって (anything)\n\nREGISTER: Casual/colloquial. Not used in formal speech or writing.\n\nSIMILAR:\n- だって: Casual, defensive\n- でも: But (more neutral)\n- だけど/けど: But (casual)",
